<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>我的雲端空間</title>
    <style>
        /* 全域設定 */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: 100vh;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        /* 頂部導覽列 (Header) */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dadce0;
            height: 64px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #5f6368;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .search-bar input {
            width: 400px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            background-color: #f1f3f4;
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
        }

        .search-bar input:focus {
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #1a73e8;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .user-profile {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            background-color: #1a73e8;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* 佈局容器 */
        .container {
            display: flex;
            flex: 1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 左側邊欄 (Sidebar) */
        .sidebar {
            width: 250px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-right: 1px solid #dadce0;
        }

        .btn-new {
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            margin: 0 15px 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #3c4043;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,0.3);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-new:hover {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .nav-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-item {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            color: #3c4043;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 0 24px 24px 0;
            margin-right: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .nav-item:hover {
            background-color: #f1f3f4;
        }

        .nav-item.active {
            background-color: #e8f0fe;
            color: #1a73e8;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* 主內容區 (Main Content) */
        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #5f6368;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* 檔案與資料夾網格 */
        .file-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            background-color: #f1f3f4;
        }

        .card-large {
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card-large .icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .filename {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #3c4043;
            font-weight: 500;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            ☁️ 偽雲端硬碟
        </div>
        <div class="search-bar">
            <input type="text" placeholder="在雲端硬碟中搜尋...">
        </div>
        <div class="user-profile">U</div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <button class="btn-new">➕ 新增</button>
            <ul class="nav-list">
                <li class="nav-item active">📁 我的雲端硬碟</li>
                <li class="nav-item">💻 電腦</li>
                <li class="nav-item">👥 與我共用</li>
                <li class="nav-item">🕒 最近存取</li>
                <li class="nav-item">⭐ 已加星號</li>
                <li class="nav-item">🗑️ 垃圾桶</li>
            </ul>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">
            
            <div class="section-title">資料夾</div>
            <div class="file-grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="icon">📁</span>
                    <span class="filename">工作專案</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="icon">📁</span>
                    <span class="filename">學習資料</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="icon">📁</span>
                    <span class="filename">2026 旅遊照片</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">檔案</div>
            <div class="file-grid">
                <div class="card card-large">
                    <span class="icon">📄</span>
                    <span class="filename">年度報告.docx</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card card-large">
                    <span class="icon">📊</span>
                    <span class="filename">財務報表.xlsx</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card card-large">
                    <span class="icon">🖼️</span>
                    <span class="filename">設計圖稿.png</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card card-large">
                    <span class="icon">🎬</span>
                    <span class="filename">宣傳影片.mp4</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
